                <pb facs="1195" n="1155" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v25/pg1155"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1961-63v25">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1961–1963, Volume XXV</ref>,
                    Organization of Foreign Policy; Information Policy; United Nations; Scientific
                    Matters. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d404">Document 404</ref>, Footnote 1,
                                <ref target="#pg915">Page 915</ref> (date of correction: February
                            22, 2018)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The citation in the document’s source note has been corrected from
                        “US/USSR” to “US/MOON.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
